# Release Quality Gates

Before declaring a change ready, run the **full** gate from the repository root
(or `scripts/quality_gates.ps1` / `scripts/quality_gates.sh`):

```powershell
ruff check pytierra tests examples
bandit -r pytierra -q -c pyproject.toml
vulture pytierra tests examples .vulture_whitelist.py --min-confidence 80
pytest tests -q --cov=pytierra --cov-fail-under=85
```

- Prefer minimal, compatibility-preserving fixes when checks fail.
- Do not skip gates silently; record any unavoidable skip and rationale.
- Package coverage target is ≥85% for `pytierra` as a whole (not per-file).
